# Without an Urza's Power-Plant and an Urza's Tower, Urza's Mine taps for exactly one colorless mana (CR 605.1a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Urza's Mine x2
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Mine.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Mine.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Mine.Tapped = true
! Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Mine.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Mine.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Mine#1.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {C}
